# Build output. CI runs `npm run build` before every deploy (deploy-frontend.yml and
# preview-deploy.yml), so it never needs to be committed. Committing rebuilt bundles made
# `git pull` fail with "local changes would be overwritten" for whoever had built locally.
dist/
